    61	### 3b. The no-flash overlay (decision 2)
    62	**The file.** `overlays/no_flash/flash_attn/__init__.py`, in a new top-level directory with no `__init__.py`, so `[tool.setuptools.packages.find]` never ships it. Exact content, sha256 `0d0e52ca693e236a2e0a44cd61f61539fdf995cff5132d1f621181a0f3e7c023`, verified in scratch:
    63	```
    64	"""No-flash overlay (exp_35; Yixun 2026-11-05 decision 2). Shadows the installed flash_attn so that
    65	src/models/transformer.py:12-18 falls back to torch SDPA, the attention backend exp_25 ran with.
    66	Put on PYTHONPATH by depth_canon_eval_run.sh only; never installed, never imported elsewhere."""
    67	raise ImportError("exp35 no-flash overlay: flash_attn disabled, attention backend = torch SDPA")
    68	```
    69	
    70	**What it does (verified in scratch on CPU).** Under it, `find_spec("flash_attn")` resolves to the overlay and the import raises the sentinel. Importing `src.models.transformer` prints the sentinel, then `flash_attn not installed, disabling Flash Attention` (`transformer.py:15-16`), and leaves `flash_attn_func is None`, so the SDPA path runs (`:439-440`) instead of the flash branch (`:429-438`). `src` still resolves to the checkout.
